Rewrite the following Java program using a while loop:
public class Monuments {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
      if (i % 2 == 0)
        System.out.println("Monument-1: Taj Mahal");
      else
        System.out.println("Monument-2: Gateway of India");
      System.out.println("Monuments of India");
    }
  }
}

modelAnswer:
public class Monuments {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    int i = 0;
    while (i < 5) {
      if (i % 2 == 0)
        System.out.println("Monument-1: Taj Mahal");
      else
        System.out.println("Monument-2: Gateway of India");
      System.out.println("Monuments of India");
      i++;
    }
  }
}

