modelAnswer:
Corrected code (corrections underlined in description):
public class JavaProg {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    int a = 0;
    int b = 15;        // Correction 1: missing 'int' data type declaration
    do {\               // Correction 2: opening brace '{' instead of parenthesis '('
      a = a + 3;
      b = b - 3;
    } while (a <= b);   // Correction 3: 'while' in lowercase; Correction 4: semicolon after closing brace
  }
}
Corrections: (1) int b = 15 — b must be declared with data type. (2) do { — opening brace not parenthesis. (3) } while — 'while' must be lowercase. (4) semicolon after } while (a <= b);

